    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:f05bd4628514c3f7",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "068e47f98794700c682307e180b4acec4155a56ac8183c6ff6f6050faf9280b4",
      "text": "On this full-day excursion, you’ll visit the municipality of El Peñol and see its varied architecture, including a replica of the old town where you can admire the colonial style.\nNext, you’ll head to the imposing El Peñón, a 220-meter monolith.\nContinue to Guatapé, known for the decorative panels at the base of its houses, with painted designs and raised reliefs. This part of the tour is by motorcycle taxi.\nFinally, visit the El Peñol–Guatapé reservoir to see the contrast between the green mountains and the mirror-like water.\nReturn to the hotel in the afternoon.\nDuration: 8 hours.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-mw6lz405-1ivofn2o2t2",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      }
    },
    {
